    "detailed_description": "Linelith is a line-drawing puzzle game set on a colorful, serene alien asteroid. Solve puzzles embedded in rocks and crystals by drawing lines in intricate patterns, conforming to their shape and their symbols. As you progress, discover a few clever twists on these mechanics that shake up the puzzles and make you look at things in a different way. Chill out and go at your own pace in this short and sweet puzzle experience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923790/extras/5ce557e9541bcc3c6530c5512d2156c2.poster.avif?t=1745611800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923790/extras/5ce557e9541bcc3c6530c5512d2156c2.webm?t=1745611800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923790/extras/5ce557e9541bcc3c6530c5512d2156c2.mp4?t=1745611800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 70 puzzles, on a gentle difficulty curve, ranging from easy to challenging<br></li><li>Every puzzle can be freely skipped to return to later<br></li><li>A soothing, serene music track, and juicy sound design by Brendan Julian<br></li><li>A versatile line-drawing mechanic which is intuitive but deep, with several twists</li></ul><br>Linelith is part of the CosmOS 9 bundle, a set of 9 puzzle games discovered on a mysterious video game console drifting in outer space.",
    "about_the_game": "Linelith is a line-drawing puzzle game set on a colorful, serene alien asteroid. Solve puzzles embedded in rocks and crystals by drawing lines in intricate patterns, conforming to their shape and their symbols. As you progress, discover a few clever twists on these mechanics that shake up the puzzles and make you look at things in a different way. Chill out and go at your own pace in this short and sweet puzzle experience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923790/extras/5ce557e9541bcc3c6530c5512d2156c2.poster.avif?t=1745611800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923790/extras/5ce557e9541bcc3c6530c5512d2156c2.webm?t=1745611800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923790/extras/5ce557e9541bcc3c6530c5512d2156c2.mp4?t=1745611800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 70 puzzles, on a gentle difficulty curve, ranging from easy to challenging<br></li><li>Every puzzle can be freely skipped to return to later<br></li><li>A soothing, serene music track, and juicy sound design by Brendan Julian<br></li><li>A versatile line-drawing mechanic which is intuitive but deep, with several twists</li></ul><br>Linelith is part of the CosmOS 9 bundle, a set of 9 puzzle games discovered on a mysterious video game console drifting in outer space.",
